2.51.2

Implement `ForeignOwnable` for `Owned<T>`. This allows use of `Owned<T>` in
places such as the `XArray`.

Note that `T` does not need to implement `ForeignOwnable` for `Owned<T>` to
implement `ForeignOwnable`.

