> 	EIC7700_PIN(18,  "gpio5",		[0] = F_GPIO, [1] = F_SPI),
> 
> There is no reason to ever partially use these as GPIO. Either they will
> be all jtag, all spi or all gpio. pin 18 on the other than makes sense to have
