-	  ADM1293, ADM1294, ROHM BD12780, and SQ24905C Hot-Swap Controller and
-	  Digital Power Monitors.
+	  ADM1293, ADM1294, ROHM BD12780, ROHM BD12790, and SQ24905C
+	  Hot-Swap Controller and Digital Power Monitors.
 
